  "notes": "Compound verb from ⟦{消|き}える→消える：02520_kieru⟧ (to disappear) + ⟦{失|う}せる→失せる：12175_useru⟧ (to vanish/be lost). Stronger and more emphatic than ⟦{消|き}える→消える：02520_kieru⟧ alone — emphasizes complete, total disappearance.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{痕跡|こんせき}→痕跡：10924_konseki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{消|き}え{失|う}せる: traces vanish\n- ⟦{希望|きぼう}→希望：00221_kibou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{消|き}え{失|う}せる: hope vanishes\n- ⟦{不安|ふあん}→不安：00836_fuan⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{消|き}え{失|う}せる: anxiety disappears\n- ⟦{霧|きり}→霧：02200_kiri⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{消|き}え{失|う}せる: fog vanishes completely\n\nIMPERATIVE FORM:\n{消|き}え{失|う}せろ！ is an extremely harsh way to say 'get lost!' It is very rude and aggressive — avoid using this casually.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{消|き}える→消える：02520_kieru⟧: to disappear (neutral)\n- {消|き}え{失|う}せる: to vanish completely (emphatic, literary)",
